<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><%- include("partials/head", {title:"DDC Pass Manager"}) %></head><body><main class="shell wide"><header class="dash-head"><div><div class="brand">THE DAILY DRIP</div><div class="eyebrow">PASS MANAGER</div></div><form method="post" action="/staff/logout"><button class="text-button">Sign out</button></form></header><p class="muted">Welcome, <%= staffName %>. Pass validity: <%= validUntil %>.</p><section class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong><%= stats.total %></strong><span>Total issued</span></div><div class="stat"><strong><%= stats.redeemed %></strong><span>Redeemed</span></div><div class="stat"><strong><%= stats.active %></strong><span>Unused</span></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">REDEEM A PASS</div><h2>Verify customer pass</h2><p class="muted small">Scan the QR code using your device camera, or enter the pass code shown below it.</p><div id="reader"></div><form id="verifyForm" class="verify-row"><input id="passCode" placeholder="DDC-XXXX-XXXX" autocomplete="off" required><button class="button" type="submit">Verify</button></form><div id="result" class="result hidden" aria-live="polite"></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="table-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER PASSES</div><h2>Recent activity</h2></div><button class="button outline small-button" onclick="location.reload()">Refresh</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Pass</th><th>Customer</th><th>Issued</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody><% passes.forEach(p => { %><tr><td><strong><%= p.code %></strong></td><td><%= p.name %><br><span class="muted"><%= p.phone %></span></td><td><%= new Date(p.created_at).toLocaleString("en-IN") %></td><td><span class="pill <%= p.redeemed_at ? 'pill-used' : 'pill-active' %>"><%= p.redeemed_at ? 'Redeemed' : 'Active' %></span><% if (p.redeemed_at) { %><div class="tiny"><%= new Date(p.redeemed_at).toLocaleString("en-IN") %></div><% } %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></section></main><script src="https://unpkg.com/html5-qrcode@2.3.8/html5-qrcode.min.js"></script><script src="/dashboard.js"></script></body></html>